From 1c056ffda9a917c545953bad4072b59d16e1c876 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wu <wuc8974@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 01:52:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): unblock pnpm build, bump fs-safe 0.4.4 to 0.4.7
 and add cli-argv export

Pre-existing danteng issues that blocked pnpm build at tsdown-unified
phase before M12:

1. @openclaw/fs-safe 0.4.4 does not export ./durability subpath but
   danteng imports it in two places at c87a41c1:
   - src/infra/tls/gateway.ts
   - src/infra/backup-archive-publication.ts
   0.4.7 added the subpath. Bump pin from 0.4.4 to 0.4.7.

2. dist/plugin-sdk/cli-argv.{js,d.ts} is built by tsdown-unified but
   missing from package.json exports field. cli-output-mode bundle
   imports it as openclaw/plugin-sdk/cli-argv and crashes at
   write-cli-startup-metadata phase. Add explicit exports entry.

3. pnpm-lock.yaml regenerated to match.

Verification:
  pnpm build  -> 4m 29.9s end-to-end, all phases pass
  dist/       = 172M, all expected artifacts present
  tsdown-unified: 3m 51s, plugins:assets, tsdown-packages, tsdown-ai,
  write-build-info, write-cli-startup-metadata, ui:build all green

Not in M1-M11 PQC crypto scope: these are dep version + exports
configuration gaps from danteng main, no PQC code touched.
